        <obo:IAO_0000115>Pulpal pain due to a dental procedure resulting in the removal of dentin from the affected tooth, which was wide, deep, or both.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:32103673</obo:IAO_0000119>
